,{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m009-0507","start":507,"end":509,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_id":"xcr_p13_j7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m009-0514","start":514,"end":516,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_id":"xcr_p13_j7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m009-0525","start":525,"end":526,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"oaj_udd_7d9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m009-0540","start":540,"end":542,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_id":"xcr_p13_j7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m009-0555","start":555,"end":558,"surface":"韓襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"9j9_xgc_3x3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m009-0559","start":559,"end":562,"surface":"公仲侈","kind":"person","person_id":"38a_7fk_ezx","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan","book_id":"b-shiji-071","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-071-chugan"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:p014","text":"齊使甘茂於楚，楚懷王新與秦合婚而驩。而秦聞甘茂在楚，使人謂楚王曰：「願送甘茂於秦。」楚王問於范蜎曰：「寡人欲置相於秦，孰可？」對曰：「臣不足以識之。」楚王曰：「寡人欲相甘茂，可乎？」對曰：「不可。夫史舉，下蔡之監門也，大不為事君，小不為家室，以茍賤不廉聞於世，甘茂事之順焉。故惠王之明，武王之察，張儀之辯，而甘茂事之，取十官而無罪。茂誠賢者也，然不可相於秦。夫秦之有賢相，非楚國之利也。且王前嘗用召滑於越，而內行章義之難，越國亂，故楚南塞厲門而郡江東。計王之功所以能如此者，越國亂而楚治也。今王知用諸越而忘用諸秦，臣以王為鉅過矣。然則王若欲置相於秦，則莫若向壽者可。夫向壽之於秦王，親也，少與之同衣，長與之同車，以聽事。王必相向壽於秦，則楚國之利也。」於是使使請秦相向壽於秦。秦卒相向壽。而甘茂竟不得復入秦，卒於魏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m014-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_id":"xcr_p13_j7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m014-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"楚懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"xjk_0i9_vc2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m014-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_id":"xcr_p13_j7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m014-0026","star